          "versionIdentifier": "1"
        }
      },
      "description": "The Climate Profile Service is planned to provide a structured climatic baseline and future projections for the regions of the case studies.Existing analysis scripts (Python/R) will be adapted to operate as backend workflows.The service will ingest regional climate datasets (EURO-CORDEX) and observational references, compute standard climate indices, and store outputs in tabular format.",
