          "versionIdentifier": "1"
        }
      },
      "description": "Convert climate variables to analysis units and aggregate daily observations into annual climate indicators. Temperature variables are converted from Kelvin to Celsius and averaged annually. Precipitation flux is converted to annual precipitation totals. The resulting datasets contain annual climate indicators for each grid point.",
