      "description": "Combine spacial average for annual scenario for each variable \n1.\tAnnual timeseries of RR (total): Sum of daily precipitation values for each year\n2.\tAnnual timeseries of TX (average): Average of daily values for each year\n3.\tAnnual timeseries of TG (average): Average of daily values for each year\n4.\tAnnual timeseries of TM (average): Average of daily values for each year\n5.\tAnnual timeseries of WS (average): Average of daily values for each year\n6.\tAnnual timeseries of RH (average): Average of daily values for each year\n\nConverting into a table with a variable per column",
